  "comments": [
    {
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "comment": "Fill 10x 46ml in 100 ml screw-cap bottles. Bubble with N2/CO2 and autoclave 121°C 15 min."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "comment": "(For marine or estuarine isolates add 100.0 g NaCl to this solution and increase the MgSO4 x 7 H2O to 15.0 g)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "comment": "Prepare in a screw-cap bottle, bubble with N2 to replace air, close tightly and autoclave."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "comment": "Bubble with CO2 and filter sterilize into sterile, gas-tight, 100 ml screw-cap bottle."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "comment": "Autoclave in a cotton-stoppered Erlenmeyer flask with an outlet tube for medium, connected to a glass outlet at the bottom of the vessel and has, at the other end, a silicon rubber tube with a pinch cock and a bell for aseptic dispensing of the medium into bottles."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "comment": "Cool to room temperature under an atmosphere of N2/CO2 in an ice bath."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "comment": "Filter sterilize into sterile, gas-tight, 100 ml screw-cap bottle."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "comment": "Filter sterilized"
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "comment": "Mix solution D, C and E. Bubble with CO2 in an ice bath under sterile conditions."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "comment": "Fill 50 ml in each bottle of solution A. Before using add 4 ml solution B and 0.1 ml solution F."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "comment": "Adjust the pH with filter-sterilised 1M Na2CO3 to 6.8 -7.1."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "comment": "Fill in sterile, N2 gassed screw-cap tubes under N2 gas."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "comment": "During the first 24 h, the iron of the medium precipitates in the form of black flocks."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "comment": "No other sediment should arise in the otherwise clear medium."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 34,
      "comment": "Feed periodically with neutralized 3% solution of sodium sulfide to replenish sulfide and with other supplement solutions (see Ref. 3365)."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "comment": "Ref. 3365: Malik, K. A. (1983). A modified method for the cultivation of phototrophic bacteria. J.Microbiol.Methods 1 : 343-352 ."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 38,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "comment": "The sulfide solution is prepared in a 250 ml screw-capped bottle with a butyl rubber septum and a magnetic stirrer."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 40,
      "comment": "The solution is bubbled with nitrogen gas, closed and autoclaved for 15 min. at 121oC."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "comment": "After cooling to room temperature the pH is adjusted to about 7.0 by adding of sterile 2 N H2SO4 drop-wise with a syringe without opening the bottle."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 42,
      "comment": "Appearance of a yellow colour indicates the drop of pH to about 8. The solution should be stirred continuously to avoid precipitation of elemental sulfur."
    },
    {
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "comment": "The final solution should be clear and is yellow in colour."
    }
  ]
}